#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:194
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As all packages must have a different package name, flavors must change "
"theirs, using `__flavor___PKGNAMEPREFIX` and `__flavor___PKGNAMESUFFIX` "
"makes this easy:"
msgstr "由于所有软件包都必须具有不同的名称，flavors 也必须修改软件包名称。使用 `__flavor___PKGNAMEPREFIX` 和 `__flavor___PKGNAMESUFFIX` 可以轻松实现："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:199
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FLAVORS=\tnormal lite\n"
"lite_PKGNAMESUFFIX=\t-lite\n"
msgstr "FLAVORS=\tnormal lite\nlite_PKGNAMESUFFIX=\t-lite\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:204
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`USES=php` and Flavors"
msgstr "`USES=php` 与 Flavors"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:208
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using crossref:uses[uses-php,`php`] with one of these arguments, "
"`phpize`, `ext`, `zend`, or `pecl`, the port will automatically have "
"`FLAVORS` filled in with the PHP versions it supports."
msgstr "使用 crossref:uses[uses-php,`php`] 并指定 `phpize`、`ext`、`zend` 或 `pecl` 这类参数时，port 会自动将其支持的 PHP 版本填入 `FLAVORS`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:210
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Simple `USES=php` Extension"
msgstr "简单的 `USES=php` 扩展"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:214
#, fuzzy
msgid "This will generate package for all the supported versions:"
msgstr "这会为所有受支持的版本生成软件包："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:220
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:231
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PORTNAME=\tsome-ext\n"
"PORTVERSION=\t0.0.1\n"
"PKGNAMEPREFIX=\t${PHP_PKGNAMEPREFIX}\n"
msgstr "PORTNAME=\tsome-ext\nPORTVERSION=\t0.0.1\nPKGNAMEPREFIX=\t${PHP_PKGNAMEPREFIX}\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:222
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "USES=\t\tphp:ext\n"
msgstr "USES=\t\tphp:ext\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:225
#, fuzzy
msgid "This will generate package for all the supported versions but 7.2:"
msgstr "这会为除 7.2 以外的所有受支持版本生成软件包："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:234
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USES=\t\tphp:ext\n"
"IGNORE_WITH_PHP=\t72\n"
msgstr "USES=\t\tphp:ext\nIGNORE_WITH_PHP=\t72\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:239
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "PHP Flavors with PHP Applications"
msgstr "PHP 应用程序的 PHP Flavors"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:242
#, fuzzy
msgid "PHP applications can also be flavorized."
msgstr "PHP 应用程序也可以使用 flavors。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:244
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This allows generating packages for all PHP versions, so that users can use "
"them with whatever version they need on their servers."
msgstr "这样便可以为所有 PHP 版本生成软件包，用户可以在服务器上使用所需版本的软件包。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:248
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PHP applications that are flavorized _must_ append `PHP_PKGNAMESUFFIX` to "
"their package names."
msgstr "使用 flavors 的 PHP 应用程序__必须__将 `PHP_PKGNAMESUFFIX` 追加到其软件包名称中。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:251
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Flavorizing a PHP Application"
msgstr "为 PHP 应用程序添加 Flavor"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:255
#, fuzzy
msgid "Adding Flavors support to a PHP application is straightforward:"
msgstr "为 PHP 应用程序添加 Flavors 支持非常简单："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:259
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "PKGNAMESUFFIX=\t${PHP_PKGNAMESUFFIX}\n"
msgstr "PKGNAMESUFFIX=\t${PHP_PKGNAMESUFFIX}\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:261
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "USES=\tphp:flavors\n"
msgstr "USES=\tphp:flavors\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:269
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When adding a dependency on a PHP flavored port, use `@${PHP_FLAVOR}`.  "
"_Never_ use `FLAVOR` directly."
msgstr "添加对使用 PHP flavor 的 port 的依赖时，请使用 `@${PHP_FLAVOR}`。__切勿__直接使用 `FLAVOR`。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:272
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`USES=python` and Flavors"
msgstr "`USES=python` 与 Flavors"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:276
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using crossref:uses[uses-python,`python`] and `USE_PYTHON=distutils`, "
"the port will automatically have `FLAVORS` filled in with the Python "
"versions it supports."
msgstr "使用 crossref:uses[uses-python,`python`] 并设置 `USE_PYTHON=distutils` 时，port 会自动将其支持的 Python 版本填入 `FLAVORS`。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:278
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Simple `USES=python`"
msgstr "简单的 `USES=python`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:282
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:305
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Supposing the current Python supported versions are 2.7, 3.4, 3.5, and 3.6, "
"and the default Python 2 and 3 versions are 2.7 and 3.6, a port with:"
msgstr "假设当前支持的 Python 版本为 2.7、3.4、3.5 和 3.6，默认的 Python 2 和 3 版本分别为 2.7 和 3.6，那么具有以下设置的 port："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:287
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"USES=\tpython\n"
"USE_PYTHON=\tdistutils\n"
msgstr "USES=\tpython\nUSE_PYTHON=\tdistutils\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/porters-handbook/flavors/_index.adoc:290
#, fuzzy
msgid "Will get these flavors: `py27`, and `py36`."
